  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/70ea77bfde19cf9c947820ef119a3839ff3642be.png\" alt=\"banner_sa\"></p><h3>賽亞人覺醒是《外星進化》的擴充模組，為 Minecraft 1.20.1 加入賽亞人變身形態。</h3><p>本模組旨在忠於《七龍珠》系列及其社群的精神。所有內容皆力求忠實還原，同時保持平衡性，並與 Omnitrix 的外星人庫完美整合。隨著開發持續推進，未來將陸續更新新增功能、生物、變身形態及建築結構。</p><p><strong>加入 Discord 伺服器！成為社群一員，搶先觀看預告、提出問題並建議新功能！</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0c3c3036461881307603b9754ec2fdd9b4f0e8c9.png\" alt=\"segment_sa\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/W5ZwaQbwan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c261b79b33380118369f4deb3bd4a6ce0df8202f.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pugmeowla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/42f9bb962b4558f1f11480e0ab885261c373f482.png\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpugmeowla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3a947a55948cefe3a8dda706f9a2e9eda11f04d8.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0c3c3036461881307603b9754ec2fdd9b4f0e8c9.png\" alt=\"segment_sa\"></p><h2>認識團隊！</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fPugmeowla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891a2035f50e27ecfc4632ac2ab24ba1d5bddc29.png\" alt=\"pugmeowla\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSpartanGamezFTB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/27017ca8ff9d10bf5b737259c2b9e8bb1c2e111a.png\" alt=\"spartan\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fkonadolomite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0ea86b9d308693fc88d3e85283cdcab28641a770.png\" alt=\"stephen\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fMiracleJeff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b85be6ce3cbfcf274060cc08f6473e6d5431755e.png\" alt=\"Jeff\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0c3c3036461881307603b9754ec2fdd9b4f0e8c9.png\" alt=\"segment_sa\"></p><h2>[重製]</h2><p>Pugmeowla（我）重新編寫了整個模組 :)</p><p>目前僅有超級賽亞人1-3及巨猿化</p><p>運作效果遠勝以往。</p><p>模組經歷了非常多變化</p><p>殺敵足夠數量並承受足夠傷害即可獲得技能點數。</p><p>當前的屬性系統</p><p>初始數值：血量20 攻擊1 防禦5 韌性5</p><p>使用1點技能點數可提升：血量+2 / 攻擊+1 / 防禦+2（同時韌性+2）</p><p>目前無上限</p><p>超級賽亞人加成倍率：ssj x1.5 / ssj2 x2 / ssj3 x2.5</p><p>範例：升級一次血量後：</p><p>基礎血量變為22</p><p>變身ssj1時為33 / ssj2 → 44 / ssj3 → 55</p>",
